# Safety net only, not a location. The ComponentAce SDK is not redistributable
# and lives OUTSIDE this repository -- by convention ../absolute-database-sdk/.
# It has never been committed here and must never be. This rule stays so that
# extracting an SDK into the tree by accident cannot stage it; nothing else is
# allowed to depend on it. See docs/provenance.md.
legacy/